  unitName: Treasure Demon Gregor
  unitId: 61027
  unitNumber: 1447
  description: Gregor is known for his obsession with obtaining the royal treasure
    of a certain nation, and fueling that obsession was the unsurmountable amount
    of research he had conducted on its hidden powers. According to some of the recorded
    data he left behind, the treasure's powers would turn its wielder into a demon.
    Had he been able to get his hands on the royal jewel and unleashed its full potential,
    he would've achieved his ideal physical form as a demon. He would have then used
    his new powers to his heart's content in order to strike fear throughout the
    whole of Grand Gaia.
  summonDesc: So this is the jewel's power...<br>I shall begin my retribution by
    crushing that insolent thief!
  fusionDesc: No one else can rival me now.<br>I have no need for more power.<br>I
    shall accept sacrifices, however...
  evoDesc: It would seem my research was on the right track.<br>Mwa ha ha ha...<br>This
    power shall make me invincible!
  element: 6
  rarity: 7
